<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>On your life’s journey maybe you’re hurting,</l><l>Just doesn’t seem like anyone cares;</l><l>Jesus is waiting for you to open—</l><l>Just call His name and He will be there!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>What if I told you Somebody loves you;</l><l>He knows your name and He knows your case;</l><l>He will not judge but simply receive you;</l><l>He loves all men, and freely gives grace!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
